#. <CLT 4>もう、こんなモニターなんかに怯えない。
#. モノクマなんか怖くない！！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'm not gonna let these things scare me anymore... I'm\n"
"not afraid of you, Monokuma!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう、こんな監視カメラなんか…
#. 心底どうでもいい…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>From the bottom of my heart, I just really wanna...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>本気で…壊してやろうかな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Maybe I'll just bust it to hell for real...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>時間に限りがあります…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't have much time left...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>さようなら！　鉄板祭り！！
#. いつか恋しくなる日が…来る訳ない！！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>See ya, metal plate party! I'm sure I'll miss you\n"
"someday... Yeah, right!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>さようなら！　鉄板祭り！！
#. いつか恋しくなる日が…来る訳ない！！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>See ya, metal plate party! I'm sure I'll miss you\n"
"someday... Yeah, right!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

